{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50446","headline":"五八 · 王梵志","name":"五八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逢迎莫不安，□□欠二爪。\n（「逢迎」二句，伯三七一六卷作「莫不安瓜肉，鱼吞在腹里」。\n）□鱼在肠里，善（郑本作喜。\n）恶有千般。\n（「□鱼」二句，斯五七九四卷作「善恶数千般，人心难可知」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}